21 0 obj
<< /A 329 0 R /Alt (Infographic detailing mechanisms of sorafenib resistance in hepatocellular carcinoma, including ABC transporter mediation, EMT, ferroptosis, and hypoxia, alongside nanomaterial-based strategies to improve drug delivery and overcome resistance. Visuals illustrate challenges such as manufacturing complexity and evidence heterogeneity versus opportunities like AI-assisted design, policy support, and development of tumor microenvironment-responsive platforms, ending with improved efficacy through nanomaterial-mediated immunomodulation and genomics integration.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 14 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
